    {
      "name": "Session (run these last, on their own)",
      "description": "Both of these end your current session. Run only ONE of them when you're done exploring — running Logout and then Delete My Account back-to-back will correctly show the second one failing with 403, since Logout already revoked the token. That 403 is the revocation feature working as intended, not a bug.",
